Sakana AI Agentic Scientist local-api research-attempt boundary
Upstream: https://github.com/SakanaAI/AI-Scientist-v3
Base: 2b8aa39285c35aaca3b0e06dd121061ef8a2d854
License: upstream Apache-2.0; retain its LICENSE and source attribution.

Only native run.sh --harness-evaluated-attempt source authoring is supported.
Campaign and full-pipeline orchestration remain unsupported for local-api.
The operator supplies absolute API Python/entrypoint paths and a pinned model.
The entrypoint consumes AI_STATISTICIAN_API_CONFIG and writes native receipts;
these are not parsed as Headless usage or reported as zero-cost Headless calls.

